{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-10-04 HKT</p>\n\n<p>現年30歲、擁有33C傲人上圍的郭奕芯（Ashina），早年憑火辣寫真集被網民封為女神。近年她轉戰電視界主持，曾被「七師傅」七仙羽勸誡封胸「戒淫邪」。不過，自兩人關係破裂後，她繼續於IG狂派福利。近日她上載一輯既貼地又極度火辣的最新美照，火速引來網民圍觀激讚。'</p>\n<h2>郭奕芯「踎低」大玩邪惡視角</h2>\n<p>最新美照中，郭奕芯顏值處於巔峰，肌膚白皙、五官精緻，對著鏡頭展露俏皮可愛表情，眼神極具電力。清純外表下，她骨子裡卻散發著野性女人味。一向親民的她更放下女神包袱，直接在街頭大方蹲下「踎低」拍照。當天她身穿超誘人貼身上衣搭配極短熱褲，在「由上而下」的邪惡拍攝角度下，將其豐滿身材表露無遺，極具視覺震撼。而短褲下一雙白滑美腿更顯得閃閃生輝，惹得一眾網民紛紛狂讚女神既貼地又性感。</p>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯早前於IG派福利，放上在清遠拍下的吊帶比堅尼照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a573c92629ccbba5ffdcf76fa7e426e/2025-09/1_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯身材迫爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63b291aa14b31591048cdc67095c5f44/2025-09/2_0_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯經常在IG派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1f42bc0595117b9ab1696487ba9e909/2022-12/unknown_278270682_670523677494287_7856323907231913707_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯一向以性感形象示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a29d4a64099da2a6fe7f4d47ec90fc7/2023-05/unknown_277242223_372493208093567_2731731464763948399_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯低胸背心加熱褲極性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05d8159e2d2b3a79864962d56379d1bd/2026-10/1_4_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯踎低用邪惡角度騷身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79a3c96699d608678893d0ff5c99cfa9/2026-10/2_2_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯美不勝收。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5da643e8b1d27ea909801960f5565d2/2026-10/3_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯性感又可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ea8c8508c43e1ec80ef420e6fdee873/2026-10/4_5_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯身材激凸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ed5a57b18c69739d77416f0573e6318/2025-09/3_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯的吊帶比堅尼照喪吸過萬Like。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f501f3dba0011e0dfc47d443bf7f66b4/2025-09/4_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯被封為女神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a7d4f3bad89853495ec8c7272fceb43/2025-09/5_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民直郭奕芯有隆胸之嫌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7171623e01db6073dba8c06930d53910/2025-09/6_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民認為郭奕芯十年前的《同班同學》已作過全裸演出，當時身材和現在相比判若兩人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d33076214ed740addcab35d6576812b9/2025-09/7_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯爆粗反擊網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be832a7a0a0657e222aa47e4cd0b0d83/2025-09/8_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯於網上盡展真性情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd527887ea6af541e10693ec67cc4851/2025-09/9_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯10年前於《同班同學》中的身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2673cedd5be98c3f1b29277039777317/2025-09/14_16.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯10年前於《同班同學》中的身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81f1cdfe1459fe4f91622606b70d04f8/2025-09/15_14.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯爆粗反擊黑粉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/245cfc834bc01c731bf2bca370cecd0e/2025-09/16_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯親解身材再度發育之謎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2df87e4a01d0692116e2c72bef24ff8c/2025-09/17_14.jpg\"/>\n<h2>郭奕芯出道大膽露點成名</h2>\n<p>回顧郭奕芯的簡歷，其星途與性格同樣惹火。她於2014年演出電影《同班同學》作露點演出入行，大膽作風一戰成名，到了2021年主持ViuTV節目《戀講嘢》，憑直率敢言的作風人氣急升。同年她與七仙羽合作節目《七救星》並拜其為師，被要求封胸「戒淫邪」，但後來郭奕芯公開指控七師傅騙財，雙方爆發隔空罵戰，導致師徒關係破裂。感情方面她於2022年曾戀富二代Brian，而私底下她亦非常剛烈，去年她發福利圖時被網民質疑隆胸，指她身材跟十年前判若兩人，郭奕芯隨即嬲爆爆粗，直嗆該網民「以為自己揸過一樣」，作風十分大膽。</p>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯早前在IG出PO，大晒內衣照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d40d22bc58049697c3a45372dc5579e/2025-07/ashina_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯的身材一覽無遺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9f0734c044046d4b094af34beee168f/2025-07/ashina_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯身材好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b81a5c72acc30e6cf7de5fc21f88b0b5/2025-07/ashina_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e07dd08e1a4f025d16af21f477ade00d/2025-07/ashina_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯的照片好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76665badbb6d99e093c894b03297e9bf/2025-07/ashina_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯早前公開水著相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e6ef34c5202a988a279e349d38c7936/2025-07/ashina_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯的打扮好消暑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c0a8e3553ec7a31aa2f1ec626517d7f/2025-07/ashina_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯大晒白滑肌膚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d864e7484f2e139572c3d8c8561812a1/2025-07/ashina_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯好有睇頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83221bbd999d3dd0a6c421e05ab55319/2025-07/ashina_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯身材好火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8b97eed99c2ed93801768a14a77b5b9/2025-07/ashina_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯大派冰淇淋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c078a944c71ba27a503b4c4652b7a28/2025-07/ashina_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯已經29歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df3dc78232f9ca6e0fa6d5011299c64e/2022-12/unknown_247623103_3196294440639422_8589514460130235990_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯側面睇非常有霸氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb301d2eb626c02af7ce1f5d07adeebd/2022-12/unknown_124038352_444402276549536_7637767600075966684_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯近年轉型做主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cef24dafc4693580b71225c5de634147/2023-05/p17_4992_r.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯不時於IG大晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e049729d5136487a0ea080a3306d13b/2023-05/unknown_95495565_542148596660846_3541699468608824085_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯不時於IG大晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05e6b191670449e77584878d6925109e/2023-05/unknown_96395017_263378771477477_8533216450507072486_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯不時於IG大晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19b2f630537ec95722047aeca8e5584a/2023-05/unknown_154262069_901420417288634_5241321702340586191_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭奕芯一向以性感形象示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/19040262eceb4353885b6a9de34707d1/2023-05/unknown_155827756_900192230716405_8522788365757915362_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T11:18:39.999325+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":622,"images":37,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}